# ============================================================================

# BITTORRENT CLIENT TRAFFIC
drop tcp any any -> any any (msg:"Torrent - BitTorrent Protocol Detected"; content:"|13|BitTorrent protocol"; depth:20; classtype:policy-violation; sid:5111036; rev:1;)

